{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_25C2966C","title":"Love from Cecil","entry":"Dlg_25C2966C::entry","exit":"Dlg_25C2966C::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_ED36C9A8","articyId":"72057611218025085","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Cecil Grimes","text":"There you are! If you weren’t so revoltingly grubby I could kiss you.","speakerId":"Ntt_6F0086F5","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"There you are! If you weren’t so revoltingly grubby I could kiss you.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":425.0,"y":375.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"20448","byteOffset":15618808,"byteLength":452}},{"id":"DFr_DE23A253","articyId":"72057611218025116","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Cecil Grimes","text":"An offer from the Pierrepont Hotel itself! I start straight away. And not a moment too soon, the place is a NIGHTMARE. It will be bliss.","speakerId":"Ntt_6F0086F5","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"An offer from the Pierrepont Hotel itself! I start straight away. And not a moment too soon, the place is a NIGHTMARE. It will be bliss.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":1325.0,"y":375.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"50148","byteOffset":33314072,"byteLength":444}},{"id":"DFr_91DF6A40","articyId":"72057611218025138","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Cecil Grimes","text":"No one ever held out a hand in friendship to me before. But you... you have made my dream come true.","speakerId":"Ntt_6F0086F5","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"No one ever held out a hand in friendship to me before. But you... you have made my dream come true.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1900.0,"y":375.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"35888","byteOffset":27924128,"byteLength":444}},{"id":"DFr_0198A818","articyId":"72057611218025152","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Cecil Grimes","text":"And in return, I am going to give you the greatest gift of all.","speakerId":"Ntt_6F0086F5","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"And in return, I am going to give you the greatest gift of all.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2500.0,"y":375.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"45369","byteOffset":31496456,"byteLength":444}},{"id":"DFr_C9EDAA36","articyId":"72057611218025180","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Cecil Grimes","text":"No. I am going to put a hygiene approval certificate on your file. Valid for a whole YEAR.","speakerId":"Ntt_6F0086F5","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"No. I am going to put a hygiene approval certificate on your file. Valid for a whole YEAR.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3100.0,"y":250.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"35239","byteOffset":25692216,"byteLength":436}},{"id":"DFr_ABBCE938","articyId":"72057611218025187","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Cecil Grimes","text":"That store has several Category F violations, I wouldn't eat there.","speakerId":"Ntt_6F0086F5","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"That store has several Category F violations, I wouldn't eat there.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3100.0,"y":625.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"18494","byteOffset":14882888,"byteLength":376}},{"id":"DFr_052B0338","articyId":"72057611218025209","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Cecil Grimes","text":"Of course. It is overwhelming. Now I must go. I have an appointment with the Pierrepont’s chief FLAVR bot. But... thank you. I will not forget it.","speakerId":"Ntt_6F0086F5","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Of course. It is overwhelming. Now I must go. I have an appointment with the Pierrepont’s chief FLAVR bot. But... thank you. I will not forget it.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3700.0,"y":375.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"37940","byteOffset":28687808,"byteLength":456}},{"id":"DFr_91CC82D5","articyId":"72057611218037715","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Cecil Grimes","text":"A tempting offer. If I had time to inspect your apartment I might have said yes.","speakerId":"Ntt_6F0086F5","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"A tempting offer. If I had time to inspect your apartment I might have said yes.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":1325.0,"y":125.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"48416","byteOffset":32651768,"byteLength":388}},{"id":"DFr_3BB1178E","articyId":"72057611218025092","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Please don't.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Please don't.","TextSheVersion":"Please don't.","TextTheyVersion":"Please don't."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":725.0,"y":375.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"28883","byteOffset":18810928,"byteLength":296}},{"id":"DFr_CF2C6A5D","articyId":"72057611218025098","type"